SUMMARY:An Introduction to Poetry (For those who don’t like poetry)
DESCRIPTION:Caroline Covington will give us a jump start on appreciating po
 ems. Even those who already love poetry will “literally” enjoy an insp
 iring evening of ideas\, tea\, and finger foods. Ms. Covington (nee Nixon)
  is a Lancaster native\, now living on Maryland's Eastern Shore. As an und
 ergraduate she studied nursing\, Bible\, and music\, and in graduate schoo
 l\, history. Along with a keen interest in the intellectual history of the
  Church Caroline also was introduced to the power of poetry during extende
 d visits to English L'Abri\, a residential study center in southern Englan
 d. She currently fills her days gardening\, knitting\, cooking\, talking o
 n the phone with family and friends\, and working alongside her husband\, 
 Will\, caring for their 1790s home. And enjoying poetry\, of course.\n\nPr
 ice: Not supplied by this calendar\; check event details\n\nSchedule liste
